.TH TIHO-BANK 1 "November 2026" "Tiho Desktop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tiho-bank \- launch Tiho with an isolated bank profile
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tiho-bank
.RI [ Firefox options ] " " [ URL ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Launches Firefox ESR using a separate profile directory. Cookies, sessions and site storage are isolated from the normal Tiho profile.
This is not equivalent to the Android Bank mode: it does not automatically detect payment domains or block screen capture and overlays.
.SH PROFILES
The profile is stored in
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/tiho/bank-profile
or
.I ~/.config/tiho/bank-profile
when XDG_CONFIG_HOME is unset.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tiho (1),
.BR tiho-private (1)
